<blockquote class="uncited"><div>One thing I found in the menu, there is an entry for 220MHz squelch, this radio does not have support for that band, can it be removed?</div></blockquote>The AT1846S RF chip used in this radio does support 220MHz. Hence why there is a squelch setting for it..<br><br>All the OpenGD77 compatible handheld radios use the same chip.<br><br>However the MD9600 mobile radio does use the same chip, and does not support 220Mhz, hence it does not have the 220MHz squelch option<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Dec 07, 2024 9:36 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
